# WA-STEALTH6 T1 — abi -> arm64-primary story (field-proven gen1 probe v2,
# docs/audits/stealth6/t1-abi-field-test.md).
#
# STRUCTURAL RULE (gen1 iron proof): x86_64 MUST stay in the abilist tail.
# packages.xml carries stale primaryCpuAbi=x86_64 for existing system apps;
# ro.product.cpu.abilist is string-matched against it at zygote fork — drop
# x86_64 and every such app dies with ZygoteStartFailedEx. abi (primary) =
# arm64-v8a satisfies the DevCheck fingerprint story; the x86_64 tail keeps
# ndk_translation'd / native x86_64 loads working.
#
# boot contract: ro.* rows ride load_persist_props_action so the
# load_persist_props build.prop re-assert cannot wipe them (S6 phase rule).
# oem-propctl = resetprop-rs; can force-set existing ro.* (getprop path).
#
# T11 (2026-11-04): WebViewZygote fix. WebView APK selects primaryCpuAbi=x86
# (PackageManager scans APK lib/ dirs; x86 has highest bridge-priority in
# AbiUtils.mAllAbis). The sandboxed renderer is forked via the secondary
# zygote (app_process32). The secondary zygote's init filter removes x86
# from its handshake ABI list because the native ISA check determines
# x86's ISA = 'x86' but zygote's own ISA = 'x86_64' (64-bit host kernel).
# FIX: set ro.dalvik.vm.isa.x86 = x86_64 so the ISA filter maps x86 ABI to
# ISA x86_64, which matches zygote_secondary ISA → x86 is kept → handshake
# succeeds → WebViewZygote preloadApp works → sandboxed renderer launches.
#
# Also set dalvik.vm.isa.x86.variant = x86 (not x86_64) so the ART runtime
# correctly JITs x86 code on x86_64 ISA (ISA=base instruction set, variant=
# microarch optimization level; x86 variant on x86_64 ISA = correct pairing).
#
# abilist32 keeps x86 (app_process32 hard-asserts non-empty; also needed
# for x86 ABI lookup path in AbiUtils).
on load_persist_props_action
    exec -- /vendor/bin/oem-propctl ro.product.cpu.abi arm64-v8a
    exec -- /vendor/bin/oem-propctl ro.product.cpu.abilist arm64-v8a,x86_64,armeabi-v7a
    exec -- /vendor/bin/oem-propctl ro.product.cpu.abilist32 armeabi-v7a,armeabi,x86
    exec -- /vendor/bin/oem-propctl ro.product.cpu.abilist64 arm64-v8a,x86_64,x86
    exec -- /vendor/bin/oem-propctl ro.dalvik.vm.isa.arm x86_64
    exec -- /vendor/bin/oem-propctl ro.dalvik.vm.isa.x86 x86_64
    exec -- /vendor/bin/oem-propctl dalvik.vm.isa.x86.variant x86
